'''Mighty Aethur Ltd.''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] event. It was added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]] adds a guaranteed chance to [[Survive|survive a lethal strike]] and gains 30% chance to [[Dodge Attack|Dodge]] attacks. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]].

